3. Feature Engineering:
Revenue = Quantity × Unit Price
Discount Amount = Revenue × Discount
Final Sales = Revenue − Discount Amount
Profit = Final Sales − Cost
Profit Margin = Profit / Final Sales

4. Exploratory Data Analysis:
Calculated total sales and profit
