5. Time-Series Analysis:
Extracted year and month from dates
Calculated monthly sales and profit
Identified best/worst months
Calculated Month-over-Month (MoM) growth
Compared regional/category performance over time

6. Outlier Analysis:
Calculated Q1 and Q3 using NumPy
Calculated IQR
Determined lower and upper bounds
Identified unusual transactions

IQR = Q3 − Q1

Lower Bound = Q1 − 1.5 × IQR

Upper Bound = Q3 + 1.5 × IQR

